<scopecontent>
<p>Series I: Subject files, 2021-2026, are housed in 3 boxes and arranged alphabetically by folder title. This series includes brochures, correspondence, meeting notes, reports, and other working papers. The bulk of the files relate to the various boards overseen by the Department of Agriculture and Forestry including: Board of Agriculture and Consumer Services, Charitable Gaming Board, Cotton Board, Milk Commission, Peanut Board, Sheep Industry Board, Tobacco Board, and Wine Board, among others. These files relate to the appointment of board members including nominations and approvals. 
</p>
</scopecontent>

<arrangement>
<p>Arranged alphabetically by folder title.
</p>
