	<scopecontent>
	<p>Governor Decision Requests, 2021-2026, are housed in 1 box and are arranged chronologically. This series documents requests sent to the Governor for his approval and may include background information with discussion and summary, as well as tracking sheets, recommendations, comments and signatures. Supplemental information may include correspondence, drafts and reports. The bulk of the requests relate to grants issued by the Governor's Agriculture and Forestry Industries Development Fund (AFID). Other topics include, but are not limited to: the acquisition of land easements, requests for approval to send letters or to submit reports and studies to the General Assembly, permission to travel on the state plane, or requests for the Governor's signature on correspondence. These requests are also often referred to as Gold Sheets.
	</p>
	</scopecontent>
	
	<arrangement>
	<p>Arranged chronologically.
	</p>
	</arrangement>
	
	
